{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Duelist, Unravel the Mystery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gensokyo faces a new Incident: a sudden craze for card duels! What secret lies behind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the shrine maiden and expert in Incident resolving, Reimu sets out to investigate\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she won\u2019t be the only one!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck-building Through Hundreds of Cards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate deck from over 200 unique cards across four seasons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat Your Opponents, Gather Your Strength!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle 30+ unique opponents, collect 100+ powerful items, and upgrade your Duelist's unique skill to confront the mastermind behind the chaos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >That\u2019s Not All\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ever-changing Arena Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Gensokyo in Tournament Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your tactical brain in Puzzle Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face legendary duelists in Challenge Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These will be waiting in the future updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449630/extras/e1a8cbe35bb71d891c532976d88b11e7.avif?t=1771122894\" width=1560 height=2925 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449630?t=1771122894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449630?t=1771122894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449630/bb67a22e2c2baef1c7356fb7472799fce801280c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771122894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai